    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Duskmire</strong>: An Enchanting 2D Action Rogue-lite Platformer<br><br>Dive into the mesmerizing world of Duskmire, where every step unveils new wonders and every spell casts a unique enchantment upon your journey. This atmospheric 2D action rogue-lite platformer invites you on a magical journey through dark, snowstorm-swept mountains and enchanted forests, where breathtaking atmospheres await at every turn.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Duskmire, the thrill of discovery and the art of mastering spell combinations define your gameplay experience. With a myriad of magical abilities at your disposal, craft and wield spells to tailor your strategy and conquer the dark and mysterious realms that await. Whether you crave fast-paced action or delight in intricate spell-crafting, Duskmire promises an exhilarating journey.<br><br><strong>SPELLS / COMBINATIONS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Discover </strong>countless new gameplay experiences by exploring the special combinations of various elements, each creating unique synergies with one another. Experiment with different combinations to uncover new strategies and enhance your mastery of the elements. In Duskmire, the ability to mix and match elements to create powerful synergies opens up a wealth of gameplay possibilities, ensuring each adventure is fresh and filled with discovery.<br><br><strong>CHALLENGE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face off against powerful enemies and embrace the challenge of returning even stronger with every defeat in Duskmire!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/2b9603df611cd0e856d2341c2b89b9e4.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Duskmire</strong>: An Enchanting 2D Action Rogue-lite Platformer<br><br>Dive into the mesmerizing world of Duskmire, where every step unveils new wonders and every spell casts a unique enchantment upon your journey. This atmospheric 2D action rogue-lite platformer invites you on a magical journey through dark, snowstorm-swept mountains and enchanted forests, where breathtaking atmospheres await at every turn.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/231827182fb300a9ffcd530fbe0fbe17.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Duskmire, the thrill of discovery and the art of mastering spell combinations define your gameplay experience. With a myriad of magical abilities at your disposal, craft and wield spells to tailor your strategy and conquer the dark and mysterious realms that await. Whether you crave fast-paced action or delight in intricate spell-crafting, Duskmire promises an exhilarating journey.<br><br><strong>SPELLS / COMBINATIONS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/f3c8283e66fe7b65fe40b1cffef23c75.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Discover </strong>countless new gameplay experiences by exploring the special combinations of various elements, each creating unique synergies with one another. Experiment with different combinations to uncover new strategies and enhance your mastery of the elements. In Duskmire, the ability to mix and match elements to create powerful synergies opens up a wealth of gameplay possibilities, ensuring each adventure is fresh and filled with discovery.<br><br><strong>CHALLENGE</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.poster.avif?t=1744830267\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.webm?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912760/extras/6845d37f7f4b1f40f7a59842ba86d93c.mp4?t=1744830267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face off against powerful enemies and embrace the challenge of returning even stronger with every defeat in Duskmire!",
